  <item>
    <title>睡眠呼吸中止症會增加黃斑部病變風險嗎？2026 系統性回顧整合分析</title>
    <link>https://hsiao.chendermatologist.com/blog/osa-amd-systematic-review-2026</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://hsiao.chendermatologist.com/blog/osa-amd-systematic-review-2026</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 26 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <dc:creator>蕭閔謙 醫師</dc:creator>
    <category>黃斑部病變</category>
    <description>2026 AJO Yaldo 等系統性回顧整合 8 篇研究、353 萬人：睡眠呼吸中止症與黃斑部病變風險顯著相關（調整 aOR 1.44，中等證據力，I²=0%）；時間風險 aHR 1.66；機轉：間歇缺氧、補體活化、脈絡膜血流不足。蕭閔謙醫師整理。</description>
    <enclosure url="https://hsiao.chendermatologist.com/assets/og/osa-amd-systematic-review-2026.png" length="0" type="image/png" />
    <media:content url="https://hsiao.chendermatologist.com/assets/og/osa-amd-systematic-review-2026.png" type="image/png" medium="image" />
    <media:thumbnail url="https://hsiao.chendermatologist.com/assets/og/osa-amd-systematic-review-2026.png" />
    <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>2026 AJO Yaldo 等系統性回顧整合 8 篇研究、353 萬人：睡眠呼吸中止症與黃斑部病變風險顯著相關（調整 aOR 1.44，中等證據力，I²=0%）；時間風險 aHR 1.66；機轉：間歇缺氧、補體活化、脈絡膜血流不足。蕭閔謙醫師整理。</p><p><a href="https://hsiao.chendermatologist.com/blog/osa-amd-systematic-review-2026">閱讀全文</a></p><p><img src="https://hsiao.chendermatologist.com/assets/og/osa-amd-systematic-review-2026.png" alt="睡眠呼吸中止症會增加黃斑部病變風險嗎？2026 系統性回顧整合分析" /></p>]]></content:encoded>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>翼狀贅肉手術後復發 vs 穩定，怎麼選？2026 NMA 35 RCT 分析</title>
    <link>https://hsiao.chendermatologist.com/blog/pterygium-surgery-fixation-methods-2026-nma</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://hsiao.chendermatologist.com/blog/pterygium-surgery-fixation-methods-2026-nma</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 23 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <dc:creator>蕭閔謙 醫師</dc:creator>
    <category>翼狀贅肉</category>
    <description>2026 AJO Terres 等發表的網絡統合分析整合 35 個 RCT、2,501 隻眼：纖維蛋白膠（FG）防復發最佳、Vicryl 縫線移植片穩定性最好、自體血便宜但位移裂開風險高、絲線肉芽風險最高已不建議。蕭閔謙醫師整理。</description>
    <enclosure url="https://hsiao.chendermatologist.com/assets/og/pterygium-surgery-fixation-methods-2026-nma.png" length="0" type="image/png" />
    <media:content url="https://hsiao.chendermatologist.com/assets/og/pterygium-surgery-fixation-methods-2026-nma.png" type="image/png" medium="image" />
    <media:thumbnail url="https://hsiao.chendermatologist.com/assets/og/pterygium-surgery-fixation-methods-2026-nma.png" />
    <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>2026 AJO Terres 等發表的網絡統合分析整合 35 個 RCT、2,501 隻眼：纖維蛋白膠（FG）防復發最佳、Vicryl 縫線移植片穩定性最好、自體血便宜但位移裂開風險高、絲線肉芽風險最高已不建議。蕭閔謙醫師整理。</p><p><a href="https://hsiao.chendermatologist.com/blog/pterygium-surgery-fixation-methods-2026-nma">閱讀全文</a></p><p><img src="https://hsiao.chendermatologist.com/assets/og/pterygium-surgery-fixation-methods-2026-nma.png" alt="翼狀贅肉手術後復發 vs 穩定，怎麼選？2026 NMA 35 RCT 分析" /></p>]]></content:encoded>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>糖尿病視網膜病變越嚴重，失智風險越高？2026 TriNetX 77 萬人世代研究</title>
    <link>https://hsiao.chendermatologist.com/blog/diabetic-retinopathy-dementia-trinetx-cohort</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="true">https://hsiao.chendermatologist.com/blog/diabetic-retinopathy-dementia-trinetx-cohort</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 23 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <dc:creator>蕭閔謙 醫師</dc:creator>
    <category>糖尿病視網膜病變</category>
    <description>2026 AJO Khangura 等發表的 TriNetX 77 萬人世代分析：糖尿病視網膜病變（DR）越嚴重，全因失智與血管型失智風險呈階梯式增加；增殖性 DR 全因失智 HR 1.58、血管型 2.08。眼科可作為失智早期 risk marker。蕭閔謙醫師整理。</description>
    <enclosure url="https://hsiao.chendermatologist.com/assets/og/diabetic-retinopathy-dementia-trinetx-cohort.png" length="0" type="image/png" />
    <media:content url="https://hsiao.chendermatologist.com/assets/og/diabetic-retinopathy-dementia-trinetx-cohort.png" type="image/png" medium="image" />
    <media:thumbnail url="https://hsiao.chendermatologist.com/assets/og/diabetic-retinopathy-dementia-trinetx-cohort.png" />
    <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>2026 AJO Khangura 等發表的 TriNetX 77 萬人世代分析：糖尿病視網膜病變（DR）越嚴重，全因失智與血管型失智風險呈階梯式增加；增殖性 DR 全因失智 HR 1.58、血管型 2.08。眼科可作為失智早期 risk marker。蕭閔謙醫師整理。</p><p><a href="https://hsiao.chendermatologist.com/blog/diabetic-retinopathy-dementia-trinetx-cohort">閱讀全文</a></p><p><img src="https://hsiao.chendermatologist.com/assets/og/diabetic-retinopathy-dementia-trinetx-cohort.png" alt="糖尿病視網膜病變越嚴重，失智風險越高？2026 TriNetX 77 萬人世代研究" /></p>]]></content:encoded>
